    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O'Gara are delighted to present No. 9 Gulistan Terrace, a superbly refurbished and extended three-bedroom terraced home presented in turnkey condition throughout. Boasting a B energy rating, this stylish home has been thoughtfully upgraded in recent years to create a bright, contemporary living space ideally suited to modern living.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with a stylish guest W.C. off with wash hand basin, heated towel rail and plumbed for a washing machine and dryer. Beyond this hall lies an impressive open plan kitchen, living and dining room with laminate flooring throughout, creating a wonderful space for everyday living and entertaining. \r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen is fitted with integrated Smeg appliances, sleek white worktops, generous storage and a breakfast bar. Large sliding doors allow an abundance of natural light and open onto a beautifully tiled, south-facing terrace, seamlessly blending the indoor and outdoor spaces.\r\nUpstairs, a striking picture window floods the landing and staircase with light. The master bedroom is exceptionally bright, benefitting from a large picture window, additional Velux rooflight and extensive built-in wardrobes. The second bedroom is another generously proportioned double bedroom while the third bedroom is currently laid out as a home office with bespoke shelving. \r\n\r\nA beautifully finished family shower room completes the accommodation and features a vanity unit, W.C., LED mirror and a luxurious walk-in shower with rainfall shower head and glass screen.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned just moments from Ranelagh Village, Gulistan Terrace enjoys one of Dublin 6's most desirable addresses. An excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, shops and local amenities are all within a short stroll, while nearby Rathmines offers an even wider range of services and leisure facilities. The LUAS at Ranelagh is just minutes away, providing swift access to St. Stephen's Green and the city centre, while numerous Dublin Bus routes and an excellent choice of parks and schools further enhance the appeal of this exceptional location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent B energy rating\r\nLarge Open plan kitchen, living and dining space with integrated Smeg appliances\r\nSouth-facing tiled terrace accessed via large sliding door\r\nExceptionally bright master bedroom with Velux rooflight and built in wardrobes\r\nPrime Dublin 6 location beside Ranelagh Village and LUAS access"
      },
